invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser.c
catches: srv_test
reason: frozen_covers puts key_share into the digest a HelloRetryRequest
  cookie carries, so the second ClientHello, whose share is the one the
  retry asked for (rfc9846.txt:1191-1213), computes a different digest
  and srv_check_retry_hello refuses every retried hello. The digest test
  in test/srv_parser_tests.h replaces the share and requires the same
  digest.

--- old
    return type != EXT_KEY_SHARE && type != EXT_EARLY_DATA && type != EXT_COOKIE &&
--- new
    return type != EXT_EARLY_DATA && type != EXT_COOKIE &&
